  "bodyHash": "4i+XhaLT8OQ=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">被動盾牌是一個可設定的模組，對盾牌機制做出了一些改變。當盾牌置於非慣用手且未使用時，將不會顯示。每當玩家右鍵舉起盾牌時，它才會再次出現。當盾牌未舉起時，它仍能抵銷部分傷害。預設為額外減傷 33%，但可在設定檔中調整。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">當盾牌在主手閒置時，也能提供相同的被動保護。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於《原味體驗》模組包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 客戶端套件\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"適用環境：客戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideShieldWhenNotInUse</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，盾牌在玩家未按右鍵時將被隱藏。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>passiveShieldPercentageDamageNegated</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.3333，最小值 0.0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家手持盾牌但未舉起時，受到攻擊所能抵銷的傷害百分比。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>盾牌置於非慣用手時隱藏，直到舉起才顯示：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"528\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>無盾牌時的預設傷害：</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"528\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>盾牌於非慣用手未舉起時的被動減傷：</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"530\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>盾牌於主手未舉起時的被動減傷：</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/passive-shield/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以自由地將此模組用於任何模組包中，只要下載連結仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在如此多的獨立模組頁面上追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
